          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2 class="legal-section__title">1. About Us</h2>
            <p class="legal-section__body">Hindawi Foundation is a charity registered in England and Wales with charity number 1181788, and with registered address York House, 41 Sheet Street, Windsor, Berkshire, United Kingdom, SL4 1DD.</p>
            <p class="legal-section__body">The products and services provided by the Hindawi Foundation shall be referred to as our "Services" for the rest of this policy. Services include the different initiatives provided by the Hindawi Foundation such as Booktime, Safahat, and Folios.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
