            <h2 class="legal-section__title">11. Termination and Cancellation</h2>
            <p class="legal-section__body">11.1 Your Agreement and any subscriptions commence on the day that we accept your order for our Services, and continue from that date for a period indicated on the Service(s) subscribed to by you. You will receive confirmation of your order in the form of access to our Services. The Agreement will automatically be terminated at the end of the subscription period.</p>
            <p class="legal-section__body">11.2 It is the sole responsibility of you as the individual that has subscribed to the Services either on your own behalf or on behalf of an Organization to request renewal of any Services that do not automatically renew in order to maintain continued access to the Services.</p>
            <p class="legal-section__body">11.3 Either party (you or us) can terminate this Agreement by notifying the other in writing if the other materially breaches any of the terms of this Agreement and fails to rectify such a breach (if capable of rectifying) within 14 calendar days of the notice of the breach.</p>
            <p class="legal-section__body">11.4 We may terminate the Agreement immediately if we believe that there has been or there is a breach of security or if you or your Users fail to comply with the terms of the Agreement.</p>
            <p class="legal-section__body">11.5 We may terminate your Agreement upon giving you 30 calendar days' notice (or less where we have a business requirement) if we discontinue the Services.</p>
            <p class="legal-section__body">11.6 Upon expiration or termination of the Agreement, Hindawi will retain your Organization's User Data for 30 calendar days, after which we may delete some or all of this data.</p>
            <p class="legal-section__body">11.7 Upon expiration or termination of the Agreement, your license to use, and access to, the Services will terminate. You and your Users must delete any Content that you or they may have downloaded from all servers or devices it may have been downloaded to. The provisions of clauses 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, and 13 will survive beyond any termination or expiration of your Agreement.</p>
